{"id":"claim:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding--co-occurrence-of-ko-and-e","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding","topics":["topic:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding","topic:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding--stacking"],"statement":{"en":"The applicative prefixes ko- and e- can co-occur on the same verb stem in either order (ko-e- or e-ko-), each promoting a different participant.","ja":"適用詞接頭辞ko-とe-は同一動詞語幹上でいずれの順序（ko-e-またはe-ko-）でも共起し、それぞれ異なる参与者を昇格させることができる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"existential","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["ko-e-","e-ko-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2006@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0004-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"refines","claim":"claim:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding--applicative-stacking-for-multiple-adjuncts","differs_in":"scope","note":"Specifies that the stacked applicatives are specifically ko- and e- in either order."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding--double-applicatives-limited-to-ko-and-e","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding","topics":["topic:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding","topic:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding--stacking"],"statement":{"en":"Double applicatives are restricted to combinations of ko- and e- (ko-e- or e-ko-), where ko- introduces an addressee or recipient and e- introduces content, with no apparent difference between the orders.","ja":"二重適用辞はko-とe-の組み合わせ（ko-e-またはe-ko-）に限られ、ko-が受話者／受取手を、e-が内容を導入し、語順による明らかな差異はない。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"universal","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["ko-e-","e-ko-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaevakobayashi2022@handbook-epub/l0100-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"refines","claim":"claim:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding--co-occurrence-of-ko-and-e","differs_in":"scope","note":"Restricts double applicatives exclusively to ko- and e- combinations and specifies their semantic roles."},{"kind":"refines","claim":"claim:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding--rarity-of-second-applicative-prefix","differs_in":"scope","note":"Identifies the specific combinations to which rare second applicative occurrences are restricted."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding--applicative-stacking-for-multiple-adjuncts","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding","topics":["topic:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding","topic:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding--stacking"],"statement":{"en":"Applicative promotion can apply to two different adjuncts on the same verb, producing stacked applicative prefixes such as e-ko-.","ja":"適用詞形成は同一動詞の2つの異なる付加詞に適用され、e-ko-のような累積した適用詞接頭辞を生じさせることができる。"},"type":"existence","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"existential","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["e-ko-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:shibatani1990@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0042-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding--rarity-of-second-applicative-prefix","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding","topics":["topic:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding","topic:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding--stacking"],"statement":{"en":"A second applicative prefix may attach to a verb stem, though such occurrences are very limited.","ja":"動詞語幹に2つ目の適用詞接頭辞が付くことがあるが、そのような生起例は極めて限られている。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"existential","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":[],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:shibatani1990@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0047-07","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding--reported-prefix-combinations-ue-uko-yayko","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding","topics":["topic:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding","topic:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding--stacking"],"statement":{"en":"Earlier grammars report combinations of valency-changing prefixes such as u-e-, u-ko-, and yay-ko-.","ja":"先行文法書では、u-e-、u-ko-、yay-ko-といった結合価変化接頭辞の組み合わせが報告されている。"},"type":"membership","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"existential","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["u-e-","u-ko-","yay-ko-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0026-04","stance":"reports"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding--derivation-of-yaykouepekere","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding","topics":["topic:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding","topic:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding--stacking"],"statement":{"en":"The combination yayko- expresses action towards oneself and combines with uepekere to form the lexicalized verb yaykouepekere 'think deeply, worry'.","ja":"yayko-の結合は「自身に向かって」という意味を表し、uepekereと結合して「深く考える、心配する」と語彙化した動詞yaykouepekereを形成する。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"singular","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["yayko-","uepekere","yaykouepekere"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0177-10","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"supports","claim":"claim:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding--reported-prefix-combinations-ue-uko-yayko","differs_in":null,"note":"Provides a Shizunai lexicalization illustrating the reported combination yayko-."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding--internal-etymology-of-uepekere","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding","topics":["topic:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding","topic:valency/applicative-stacking-relativization-feeding--stacking"],"statement":{"en":"The verb uepekere 'tell (a story)' is lexicalized from reciprocal u-, applicative e-, the root peker 'be bright', and causative -e.","ja":"動詞uepekere「（話を）語る」は、相互のu-、適用詞e-、語幹peker「明るい」、使役接尾辞-eから語彙化されたものである。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"singular","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["uepekere","u-","e-","peker","-e"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0177-11","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
